      "english": "Stranger",
      "speaker": "Anonymous speaker label",
      "context": "A collapse sound alarms Carlo. The other person groans and Carlo urgently checks what happened and whether the person is all right. Original controls transition to an inn room. The stranger stirs, Carlo recognizes consciousness,and the stranger asks where this is. Carlo explains that the person had collapsed at the port and was brought to the inn. The stranger apologizes for the trouble. Carlo reassures the stranger,remarks on their unwell appearance,advises rest and politely prepares to leave. Called back and asked whether he is a doctor,Carlo explicitly says no. The stranger offers an unnamed thank-you gift. Carlo initially declines. The stranger insists,Carlo accepts and repeats a caution to take care. The stranger agrees and thanks him. A separate FE notice states that Carlo's Charm increases by1. No specific diagnosis,carrying method,medical credentials, spoken book title,romance,kinship,payment or new occupation is established. All four directly found route copies contain the same complete19 speeches and native commands;only SC3 header byte2 differs.",
